{"id":"wb-6-622","name":"三苏祠和墓","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T13:25:15+00:00","status":"ready","title":"三苏墓","text":"三苏墓，也称三苏坟，俗称苏坟、苏家坟。位于河南省平顶山市郏县西北五十里的小峨眉山麓，是北宋时期知名“三苏”的苏洵、苏轼、苏辙三人的墓冢。2006年，列入第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E8%8B%8F%E5%A2%93","revisionId":93684377,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93684377","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"复核名称、所在地与对应遗址；原名录行政地址及参考点位不作为唯一判断依据","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f9c53636e712ae11a94b81eb.jpg","title":"20240710_Tombs_of_Three-Su_03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240710_Tombs_of_Three-Su_03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/48/20240710_Tombs_of_Three-Su_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​郏县三苏墓","width":320,"height":213,"matchEvidence":"已复核文物对应百科条目的主图","subject":"三苏墓"}}